here the hazard of rainfall during a dry spell is increasing over time. We test this prediction using an original dataset of whether ethnic groups around the world traditionally prayed for rain, and find that ethnic groups facing an increasing rainfall hazard are 47% more likely to pray for rain. The replication package includes all data, code (R, Stata, and MATLAB), and documentation needed to reproduce the tables and figures in the paper and online appendix. The main analysis pipeline is executed via a single shell script (main.sh). An renv lockfile is provided for R package version control."},"dsDescriptionDate":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2026-05-01"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Religion"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Z12"},"keywordVocabularyURI":{"typeName":"keywordVocabularyURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https://www.aeaweb.org/jel/guide/jel.php"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Economic History: Labor and Consumers, Demography, Education, Health, Welfare, Income, Wealth, Religion, and Philanthropy: Europe: Pre-1913"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"N33"},"keywordVocabularyURI":{"typeName":"keywordVocabularyURI","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https://www.aeaweb.org/jel/guide/jel.php"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Climate; Natural Disasters and Their Management; Global Warming"},"keywordVocabulary":{"typeName":"keywordVocabulary","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primiti